Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The base resource everything inherits from.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Resource defines the machinery every resource shares: URI lookup and child
Meta.documentation:enumeration, the processor model (one processor instance per flow), port
Meta.documentation:declaration by naming (in_* / out_*), connection binding with $all/$explicit/
Meta.documentation:group conventions, cloning and scoping.
